SCOUT_SCREEN briefing-survey-selected choice=survey active_time=0.0 oxygen=120.0 tools={ "emp": 2, "decoy": 3, "recon": 2 } labels=["01 / SHELF SIGNAL", "A repeating signal rises from the shelf. Photograph the listening spire, then bring Quietus home. Your charts show rock, not what waits behind it. Sonar reveals water but announces your position.", "ORDERS\nTap water to replace your route. REPLACE toggles explicit queueing. Select Quietus or either drone. Use CAMERA within 240m of a gold record marker. Return Quietus to the extraction ring after all records are secured.", "SPACE / PAUSE grants unlimited planning time. Silent running is slower and quieter. Disruption interrupts nearby Sirens for 12 seconds. Cover blocks sonar and enemy sight."]
